# Editors and local settings.
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
.claude/

# Build intermediates and products, never distributed: every tool keeps them under its own .build/.
.build/
obj/
bin/
Source/obj/
Source/bin/

# Generated Pickle reports (10 GB seen on 2026-09-23: screenshots, Player.log, junit.xml, one
# folder per aggregate pass). -EvidenceDir writes here on request; it is proof kept for a session
# to read, not something the repository carries. Copy the one screenshot or message that matters
# into a README or a PR description instead of committing the folder.
evidence/

# Textures are shipped as PNG; a compiled .dds is a build product, not a source.
*.dds

desktop.ini
Art/.render/
# Generated intermediates of the icon/preview render (scripts/Render-Preview.cjs, scripts/Make-PreviewBadge.ps1): regenerate, never commit.
# The sources (ModIcon-source.png, Preview-source.png, Preview.config.json) and Mod/About/{ModIcon,Preview}.png stay tracked.
Art/ModIcon-badge.png
Art/Preview.png

# Showcase prompt, deleted once the illustration exists (STYLE_RIMWORLD.md)
PROMPT_*.md
